   "id": "H2035_L2_dps48_mod3_hensel",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "✗ **H2035_L2_dps48_mod3_hensel** · hypothesis\n\nReducing DPS-48 (arXiv:2603.18699, Z[1/2]) modulo 3 to {-1,0,1} gives an exact F3 rank-48 scheme with consistent 3-adic Hensel system J3*x = R3 mod 3 whose affine solution space or ZT flip-graph neighborhood contains an exact integer rank-48 scheme (p1)\n\n*why dead:* [L-F4R3-003=0] Proved exact decomposition of DPS-48 151D Jacobian kernel into 141D De Groote+torus and a smooth unobstructed 10D variety V_10 = 4D B4 (rational curve s=-tau/(tau-1)^2, u=-tau/(tau+1)^2 on special_16 quadruplets Q1..Q4) + 1D v32 (gl4^3 stabilizer of T_spec on other_32) + 5D TQ1..TQ4 coupling; proved by pair-Hadamard block-diagonalization that rank_F(T_spec)=16 and rank_F(T(TQ_k))=12 over every field F, so V_10 preserves rank 48 and 2-adic valuation.",
   "x": 840,
   "y": 880,
   "width": 380,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "H2035_L3_v10_integer_trace_locus",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "✗ **H2035_L3_v10_integer_trace_locus** · hypothesis\n\nConstruct the exact finite rank-48 rational scheme on the 10D non-De-Groote moduli variety V_10 at c=(+-2,0,0,0,0,0) and (0,+-2,0,0,0,0) where all 1176/1176 pairwise traces Tr(M_i M_j) become integers (eliminating the Moran-Schwartz-Yuan Feb 2026 half-integer trace obstruction) and test whether GL_4(Q)^3 x G_m^96 transforms it into an exact integer Z scheme (p1) or collinear flip reduction.\n\n*why dead:* [L-F4R3-004=0] Proved that the Kuranishi quadratic obstruction map Sym^2(N_10) -> coker(J) vanishes identically (0/55 singular values > 1e-7) so DPS-48 lies on a smooth 10D rational moduli variety V_10 outside the De Groote orbit, and reconstructed exact rational points along v32(tau) (EXACT RATIONAL BRENT MATCH over Q: True at tau=1/2, 1/3, -1/3 with V[0](tau) = tau/(2(1+tau)(2+tau)) and U[0][4](tau) = -(2+2*tau+tau^2)/(2-tau^2)). While the first-order trace gradient on C6 = N_10/B4 has rank 6 and makes all 1176/1176 linearized traces integers at c=(+-2,0,0,0,0,0) and (0,+-2,0,0,0,0), the exact finite rational parameterization on V_10 has 2-adic valuation v_2 < 0 at all rational tau avoiding the poles tau in {-1, -2, +-sqrt(2)}.",
   "x": 1260,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 380,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "1"
  },
