   "type": "text",
   "text": "✗ **H2035_L4_m2_cyclic_z4_or_333_sat** · hypothesis\n\nM2 Structural Pivot from continuous DPS-48 deformation: (A) test cyclic/dihedral symmetry-reduced SAT/ILP/Hensel lifting for <4,4,4> rank 47 over Z/4Z (p2) or integer rank 48 over Z from non-DPS orbits (p1), or (B) symmetry-breaking SAT/CAD lower-bound certificate for <3,3,3> rank 22 over GF(2) (p3).\n\n*why dead:* [L-F4R3-005=0] Proved DPS-48 has a 16-element exact integer subgroup G_16 <= GL_4(Z)^3 partitioning its 48 rows into 4 orbits (16+16+8+8) and 6 free orbits (6x8) under G_8^(A)=(Z_2)^3, while rank_F2(U_0 odot V_0 mod 2) drops from 48 to 28 and nonlinear traces on V_10 acquire quadratic non-integer terms (non_int=192..464); C++ C3 orbit-flip search (50.2M flips) reached k=16 orbits (rank 50/51 on n=4 with 17 Z4 lifts, and k=8/rank 25 on n=3) because Moosbauer-Poole C3xZ2 congruence 6k+|P| skips 47 and 48 and random top-down walks stall at k=16.",
   "x": 1680,
