   "text": "✗ **H2035_L6_direct_z_and_z4_from_r49** · hypothesis\n\nM2 Representation Pivot (Direct Ring Walk from Rank 49): By Theorem 7, to guarantee Z / Z_4 validity we must start inside the cw=0 coset (the known rank-49 ternary integer schemes alphatensor_Z and perminov_ZT) and walk directly in the Z-flip / Z_4-flip graph via 3-collinear plus-transitions (49 -> 50 -> 49 -> 48 over Z for p1, and -> 47 over Z_4 for p2).\n\n*why dead:* [L-F4R3-007=0] Across 731,637 direct integer flips over Z from at49_Z and perminov49_ZT, 0/731,637 reductions to R=49 produced a rank-49 state with available Z-flips because sign mismatches like (1,1) vs (1,-1) over Z prevent factor collisions that exist mod 2.",
